\'93No. I just wanted to get one down before, you know, the bar exploded.\'94 She gingerly looked around the interior as if expecting the structure to collapse around them at any moment.\
\'93Makes perfect sense to me.\'94 He said and they both giggled like children in a roomful of puppies. They drank and they danced and they drank as they danced. The Elvi really kicked ass and they were happy. 
